ion uses the arithmetic mean of all four task AUCs; all tasks are reported separately.\",\n        \"Validation includes every sample; upstream default drop_last may omit remainders.\",\n        \"In-process DataLoader (num_workers=0): container shared memory is512MiB; all compared runs use the same loading policy.\",\n        \"No torch.compile; BF16; TF32 disabled.\"\n      ],\n      \"trial_cap_seconds\": 1208.5413760878146,\n      \"estimated_unit_seconds\": 483.4165504351258,\n      \"estimated_validation_seconds\": 75.56942507252097,\n      \"frozen_unix\": 1794198639.34825,\n      \"identity\": \"427fc51900560816321ba9bbc170639eb26625972df75b22e3c47d523c363748\"\n    },\n    \"method\": \"auto\",\n    \"budget_scope\": \"The research wall clock starts at protocol.research_budget.start_unix under its recorded start_event. Original acquisition uses verified download completion; an explicitly requested rerun on already verified data has its own fixed campaign start. Every later preparation step, calibration, agent call, failure, training/control and scoring job counts.\",\n    \"no_test_feedback\": true,\n    \"knowledge_revision\": \"knowledge-access-v3\",\n    \"knowledge_review\": {\n      \"policy\": \"Evaluate relevant external references against local evidence; adoption is optional. Missing source detail and negative transfer remain explicit.\",\n      \"proposal_output\": \"Add top-level knowledge_assessments: [{knowledge_id, decision: used|considered|rejected|unresolved, rationale, transformed_mechanism, variant_names, nearest_work_difference, falsifier}]. Cover retrieved industry cards; identify the concrete changed mechanism for used cards. This is provenance, not causal proof.\",\n      \"reflection\": \"Review the latest knowledge-usage.json alongside outcomes; distinguish declared use, executed changes, mechanism evidence and unresolved attribution.\"\n    },\n    \"latest_knowledge_usage\": null,\n    \"selection_policy\": {\n      \"id\": \"taobao