atching hashes/protocol'], 'decision_if_supported':'Compute interaction (pair_mean - frozen_g0) - (frozen_g1 - separate_base), and both simple effects; report a source-bundle interaction only, without pair-only causal claims.','decision_if_not_supported':'Report redundancy, negative transfer or lack of interaction as observed, without selecting another metric or treating one failure as universal refutation.'}\n]\nstudy={\n'id':'g1-t002-compact-transfer-factorial-v1','protocol_ref':protocol,\n'evidence_refs':['baseline-din','g0-r0017-pair_rank_occupancy','g1-r0009-compact_mean'],\n'question':'Does the exact committed compact-mean residual improve the stronger g0 pair-rank-occupancy representation beyond macro AUC 0.831886841754755, and beyond an equal-active-capacity DIN-summary replacement, under the frozen protocol?',\n'hypothesis':'The g0 global DIN sum uses target-dependent signed unnormalized weights. A separately normalized uniform mean of the same valid history values may preserve global behavior composition suppressed by these weights, complementing pair occupancy and field/feedback summary tokens. The shared, zero-start low-rank residual may improve all-task ranking without an event/query retrieval stack. The source score gap alone does not establish this mechanism.',\n'nearest_work':[\n {'source_ref':'g0-r0017-pair_rank_occupancy','verification':'implementation_checked','difference':'Inherit the complete source representation and add only the committed compact terminal residual. The source remains the frozen utility/no-residual control.'},\n {'source_ref':'g1-r0009-compact_mean','verification':'implementation_checked','difference':'Copy TaskRead, TaskMixer and TerminalRetrieval AST exactly, including historical construction/pruning to retain initialization. Transfer its active residual to g0; do not import its no-pair/separate bundle into the candidate.'},\n {'source_ref':'baseline-din','verification':'implementation_checked','difference':'Inherit local activation, embeddings and four-task heads through the committed sources; retain baseline as the initial quality/cost reference.'},\n {'source_ref':'paper:hiformer','verification':'read','difference':'Original arXiv:2311.05884v1 sections3.1-3.5 inspected via https://arxiv.org/html/2311.05884v1. Heterogeneous/composite attention and low-rank/pruned task reads are established ideas. This implementation tests an inherited uniform residual alongside pair-occupancy summaries; no originality or full-paper reproduction claim.'},\n {'source_ref':'unirank-code:HiFormer','verification':'implementation_checked','difference':'Pinned forward lines113-159 pool history with target attention before field/task token interaction. Our candidate retains committed relation/pair summary tokens and adds a shared mean residual to a raw pooled feature, without changing attention parameterization.'}\n],\n'inherited_components':['Frozen source embeddings and DIN local activation over the six target/history item fields','35 temporal/relation summary tokens, full linear rank moments, residual and relation/content banks, factorized feedback-content bank','g0 conjunctive pair content/count and pair-rank occupancy banks, collapsed feedback memory, JointBlock and original four towers','Exact g1 compact residual initializer, valid-event uniform pooling,112->32->112 low-rank maps, non-affine LayerNorm,112->112 zero-initialized output map and empty-history gate'],\n'proposed_difference':'Append the unmodified g1 compact residual after g0 source construction in a CPU RNG fork; add its update to the global DIN-sum portion of each tower input. All tasks receive the same residual summary/maps; this is not task-adaptive retrieval. Two controls replace its input by DIN at identical active capacity, and remove it from the g1 representation to complete a source-bundle-by-residual factorial with the frozen receipts.',\n'predictions':['pair_compact_mean exceeds both frozen source macro AUCs, specifically 0.831886841754755; record every task AUC and Logloss delta against DIN and both sources.','pair_compact_mean exceeds pair_compact_din if uniform history content supplies information or a useful optimization path beyond shared extra capacity.','The gain from mean versus no residual can differ between the two source bundles; evaluate the declared difference in differences without interpreting it as a pair-bank-only effect.','No speedup over g0 is presumed: the transferred path adds work and19,712 parameters. Measure train/wall/inference time, batch p50/p95, peak memory and parameter counts; compare observed quality/cost points.','The direct residual is exactly gated off on empty histories; retraining can still change empty-history predictions through shared learned weights.'],\n'falsifiers':['Macro AUC at or below0.831886841754755 falsifies the predicted utility for the merged implementation.','No improvement over the equal-capacity DIN replacement fails to support a uniform-specific advantage.','A nonfinite forward/backward, dependence on masked item/action/task-mask entries, current-action sensitivity, source-replay mismatch, or protocol/hash mismatch invalidates a comparison until resolved within budget; it is not scientific counterevidence.','No positive bundle interaction fails to support the proposed synergy; positive simple effects without interaction would instead support additive transfer.','A quality gain with higher measured cost does not establish efficiency; without an equal-compute point report only the measured frontier trade-off.'],\n'alternative_explanations':['Extra capacity or normalized nonlinear residual reparameterization rather than uniform history information','Representation bundle differences, especially separate versus collapsed feedback content','Dense clipping/optimization changes from additional gradients','Single-seed noise, validation multiple selection and source selection history','Offline delayed-feedback visibility and benchmark auxiliary labels; no production point-in-time claim'],\n'contrasts':contrasts,\n'cost_plan':{'estimate_ref':'runtime context.remaining_seconds=2211.7539908885956 at proposal snapshot; g0-r0017-pair_rank_occupancy wall569.63s; g1-r0009-compact_mean wall512.95s; protocol estimated unit483.42s and validation75.57s.','all_variants_counted':True,'attribution_reserve':'Queue pair_compact_mean~610s, pair_compact_din~610s and separate_base~510s, total1730s including their full validation. Two controls are attribution expenditure, not free diagnostics. Reserve50s for host preflight and100s for failures/variance. Recheck live ledger before each complete unit; estimates are not guarantees.','assessment_reserve':'Reserve50s for validation-only receipt/comparison collation, beyond validation already included in unit estimates; allow up to250s total proposal preparation. Total planned envelope2180s against2211.75s snapshot. Three paired seeds do not fit. No repetition is silently promised: all new evidence remains preliminary single-seed. If measured savings fund a complete paired repetition plus assessment reserve, request it through the authorized subsequent phase; otherwise explicitly omit.','stop_rule':'Never launch training here. Host must preserve its live hard deadline and1208.54s per-trial cap. Before each queued run, require its current full-unit estimate plus all remaining essential attribution/assessment reserves to fit; if not, defer that run and mark affected attribution incomplete. No automatic retries, no budget increases, no withheld assessment, no score-driven protocol changes.'}\n}\nvariants=[]\nfor name,file,role,note in [\n ('pair_compact_mean','candidate.py','candidate','Primary transfer; all g0 source paths preserved plus exact compact uniform residual. Predicted33,150,117 total parameters, not measured.'),\n ('pair_compact_din','control_pair_din.py','control','Equal-active-capacity replacement of uniform input with existing global DIN summary; same residual initialization and maps. Predicted33,150,117 parameters, not compute matched.'),\n ('separate_base','control_separate_base.py','control','g1 source bundle without compact residual; no registered terminal or pair modules. Completes the2x2 with frozen source receipts. Predicted33,022,405 parameters, not measured.')]:\n variants.append({'name':name,'file':file,'role':role,'config':config(file),'note':note+' SHA256 '+hashlib.sha256(Path(file).read_bytes()).hexdigest()+'. Syntax and static inheritance checked; host numerical preflight required.'})\nobservations=[]\nfor h in r['context']['history']:\n v=h['validation']\n observations.append({'trial_id':h['id'],'status':h['status'],'source_sha256':h['source_sha256'],'protocol_ref':protocol,'macro_auc':v['macro_auc'],'macro_logloss':v['macro_logloss'],'per_task':v['per_task'],'parameters':h['parameters'],'train_seconds':h['train_seconds'],'wall_seconds':h['wall_seconds'],'inference_seconds':v['inference_seconds'],'batch_latency_ms_p50':v['batch_latency_ms_p50'],'peak_gpu_bytes':h['peak_gpu_bytes']})\nproposal={\n 'study':study,'parent_trial':'g0-r0017-pair_rank_occupancy','variants':variants,\n 'knowledge_assessments':[\n {'knowledge_id':'unirank-method-hiformer','decision':'considered','rationale':'Nearest stacked history/field interaction reference; original sections3.1-3.5 and pinned benchmark forward inspected. The current intervention transfers committed local code rather than adopting the card architecture.','transformed_mechanism':'No new card-derived change; heterogeneous/composite attention and pruning are prior work.','variant_names':[],'nearest_work_difference':'Shared uniform residual on raw DIN summary alongside inherited relation/pair tokens, without a new heterogeneous attention layer.','falsifier':'A local failure or success does not test original HiFormer; no effectiveness transfer claim.'},\n {'knowledge_id':'unirank-method-tokenformer','decision':'considered','rationale':'Card describes direct field/event exchange. Replacing the complete stack would confound the requested transfer and exceed the attribution budget; original full paper not audited.','transformed_mechanism':'None adopted; retain source summary tokens and strict masking.','variant_names':[],'nearest_work_difference':'No full event-token interaction stack or Flex Attention adoption.','falsifier':'Do not assert superiority over TokenFormer without an authorized matched implementation and measurement.'}\n ],\n 'source_observations':observations,\n 'factorial_cells':[\n {'representation':'pair_occupancy_collapsed','aggregation':'none','reference':'g0-r0017-pair_rank_occupancy','status':'committed_validation'},\n {'representation':'pair_occupancy_collapsed','aggregation':'uniform','reference':'pair_compact_mean','status':'proposed'},\n {'representation':'no_pair_separate','aggregation':'none','reference':'separate_base','status':'proposed'},\n {'representation':'no_pair_separate','aggregation':'uniform','reference':'g1-r0009-compact_mean','status':'committed_validation'}],\n 'host_preflight':[\n 'Count all diagnostics against the live budget. Verify pinned dataset identity and frozen loader/scoring hashes through host-owned checks; raw data are unavailable in this coding phase.',\n 'Seed CPU/GPU identically and compare candidate representation_source=pair_occupancy, memory_layout=collapsed, aggregation_mode=none to the frozen g0 module: registered tensors, outputs, next CPU RNG draws and input ordering. No claim of verified trained replay.',\n 'Compare candidate representation_source=separate_base, memory_layout=separate, aggregation_mode=uniform to frozen g1: registered tensors, outputs and RNG state. Exact AST preservation alone does not prove framework initializer parity.',\n 'Uniform/DIN arms must share all initial tensor values. At zero output initialization they must match g0 predictions. Expected compact trainable increment=2*112*32+112*112=19,712; pair increment=15*(113+112)*32=108,000.',\n 'In train/eval and 